@IntelliMeet.Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5172

### List meetings (seeded demo)
GET {{IntelliMeet.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/meetings
Accept: application/json

###

### Meeting detail (replace with seeded id from GET list)
GET {{IntelliMeet.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/meetings/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Accept: application/json

###

### Dashboard upcoming
GET {{IntelliMeet.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/upcoming-meetings
Accept: application/json

###

### Todos
GET {{IntelliMeet.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

###
